{
 "koral-function": 1,
 "purpose": "Lighting",
 "description": "A picture's ambient occlusion traced into `scene` (a RayScene's `scene`: nothing is hit while it has nothing, and what casts no shadow, its `noShadow`, never): from each pixel's place \u2014 its `depth` back through `inverseViewProjection` \u2014 and its `normals` (xyz), `rays` rays cosine-spread within `radius`, the share that hit nothing; another set each `frame`. `occlusion` is it (R16F, 1 open): noisy, for the filters module's Denoise.",
 "tags": [
  "ambient occlusion",
  "rtao",
  "ray traced",
  "occlusion",
  "ray query",
  "lighting"
 ],
 "graph": {
  "kgraph": 1,
